IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0015.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY LON0015C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIRED
    05 M-II               PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> RATE ADJUSTMENT
    05 RA-RT              PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CHECK-LTV
    DISPLAY "M-II=" M-II
    DISPLAY "RA-RT=" RA-RT
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-LTV.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIREMENT - LIMIT 42 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF TX-WS-LTV GREATER THAN 85
        MOVE 'Y' TO M-II
        MOVE 0.0050 TO RA-RT
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO M-II
    END-IF.
